    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="63ac0e85-44cd-528a-8e6c-b12b1ff8af8d" activityNameId="0818b486-3e1b-5579-877c-c7557e905c77" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">xx Wind power plant 30kW, fixed parts</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx Wind power plant 30kW, fixed parts
Lifetime is assumed to be 40 years. Annual electricity production is assumed to be 21 MWh. Data are from a specific wind power plant, installed 1990 on Simplon, Switzerland. The foundation (concrete and reinforcing steel) is assumed to be remaining in the ground after the demolition of the power plant.;
UUID: cb0abe80-d2e1-38eb-990d-007ac5051cc0
Includes materials used for fixed parts: tower and base, and their disposal. Also includes the prozessing, transports needed, and the area that is needed for installation and the installation itself.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Data for a specific Swiss 30 kW wind power plant, installed in the year 1990.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_cb0abe80-d2e1-38eb-990d-007ac5051cc0.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
